.TH HTTP_GET 3
.SH NAME
http_get \- start an HTTP GET request
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <http.h>
.P
.BI "int http_get(http* " h ", const char* " location ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR http_get ()
is
.BR http_open (3)
with the method GET. A GET has no body.
.SH RETURN VALUE
1 on success, 0 on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
http_open(3), http_post(3)
